          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwishirowe, Asa wafwa achizikpwa kpwenye mudzi wa Daudi, phamwenga na akaree. Mwanawe Jehoshafati achitawala badalaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaka wa phiri wa utawala wa Asa hiko Juda, Nadabu mwana wa Jeroboamu waandza kutawala tsi ya Iziraeli. Watawala muda wa miaka miiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nadabu wahenda mai mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu. Walunga mwendo wa ise na kosare ra kuasababisha Aiziraeli kuhenda dambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Baasha mwana wa Ahija, wa mbari ya Isakari, wampangira njama mbii ya kumuolaga Nadabu. Hipho Nadabu na Aiziraeli osi ariphokala anashambuliya mudzi wa Gibethoni wa Afilisti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baasha wamuolaga, na achitawala badalaye. Hinyo wakala mwaka wa hahu wa utawala wa mfalume Asa wa Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.14.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Afalume 14:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mara tu ariphoandza kutawala, Baasha waolaga atu osi a nyumba ya Jeroboamu. Kayaricha moyo hata mutu mmwenga wa nyumba ya Jeroboamu. Iyo yakala sawa na gara Mwenyezi Mlungu arigogomba kpwa njira ya mtumishiwe Ahija wa mudzi wa Shilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mambo higa gahendeka kpwa sababu Jeroboamu wamtsukiza Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa Iziraeli, kpwa dambiye na kpwa kuasababisha Aiziraeli ahende dambi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
